# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3024
translate chinese overthrow_end_8081d14a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}邓肯之死，是他一生合乎逻辑的终局，也是为他野心过甚付出的代价。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3026
translate chinese overthrow_end_83e8dcb1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他被成功与不受追究的逍遥冲昏了头脑，竟想趁王权虚弱之际，向王座本身发号施令。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3028
translate chinese overthrow_end_ee95cb23:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但他忘了，王权的虚弱终有转为强盛之时。到那时，所有把头抬得太高的人，都不得不赶紧俯下身来。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3030
translate chinese overthrow_end_01d1a864:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}否则，就要人头落地。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3032
translate chinese overthrow_end_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3034
translate chinese overthrow_end_c1d61b62_2:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}给手下的兵卒留下半天功夫洗劫城堡之后，次日一早，你便率队折返，平安回到了自己的领地。{vspace=5}获得[randomroll]弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:3036
translate chinese overthrow_end_53c02e0e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}国王爱德华对你圆满完成他所交付的差事表示了感谢。"

