# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:4451
translate chinese unfinished_business_2_postfight_8d57cd4a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}守军人数虽然不少，却明显士气低落，斗志全无。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:4453
translate chinese unfinished_business_2_postfight_204f07b6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}感受到你们进攻的凌厉，眼见你们抱定拼死的决心，他们开始节节败退，一心只求保住性命。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:4455
translate chinese unfinished_business_2_postfight_1e759559:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}奇彭纳姆守军有组织的抵抗，就此被彻底粉碎。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:4457
translate chinese unfinished_business_2_postfight_ab78ce4d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你下达命令，让队伍继续肃清城堡，自己直奔侯爵的居室，一脚踹开房门闯了进去。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:4459
translate chinese unfinished_business_2_postfight_aca806aa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}来得正是时候——你与邓肯撞了个面对面，他正拖着一只沉甸甸的箱子，朝一扇偏僻的小门走去。"

