    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11796
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_cf319d38:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}艾丽莎仿佛在你面前摆出了一整支军队。然而，尽管人多势众，她的人却拿你毫无办法——论起战斗技艺，他们没有一个配做你的对手。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11798
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_82184aa8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你一个接一个地将他们尽数击败。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11800
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_20908cb5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}是的，论政治、手腕与权谋，她比你聪明得多，也老练得多。{vspace=5}{w}是的，你犯了错。{vspace=5}{w}是的，她把你耍得团团转。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11802
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_4791cecd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但那又怎样？再精巧的阴谋之网，也经不起一剑斩断。而这柄剑，正握在你手中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11804
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_09149f1c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}艾丽莎注定要死。她死定了。就在此地，就在此刻。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11806
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_a14a9d78:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}放倒艾丽莎的最后一名骑士后，你得意地扬起头，目光搜寻着那个躲在众人背后的女人。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11808
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11816
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_f7777fea:

    h "{cps=50}Пришло время умирать, Алиса."
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11817
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_5cac7d7a:

    al "{cps=50}Ну так умри уже."
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11822
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_9e309d32:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}她身旁的六名弩手同时齐射，弩箭扎满了你的身体，将你击倒在地。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11824
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_a4f7b027:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}国王[name]的统治，就这样走到了尽头。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11826
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_1aa31c89:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}亚历山大三世国王坠马而亡。{w}腓特烈皇帝溺水而死。{vspace=5}{w}而你，死在了一支弩箭之下。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:11828
translate chinese showdown_with_alyssa_postfight_43235fef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}人各有命。"

