# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13754
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_14c7e4fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}两座棱堡的陷落，使突尼斯的命运再无悬念——它的防御手段实际上已告穷尽。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13756
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_6d070740:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}苏丹深知大势已去，遣使向你求和。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13758
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_202622dd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他同意成为英格兰的附庸，缴纳赔款、定期进贡，并准许基督教神父在突尼斯自由定居、在城中教堂传道布教。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13760
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_5e177537:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他唯一的条件是：不得洗劫屠城。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13764
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_2172378a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你应允了他的条件，收下约定的赔款，载誉而归。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13766
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_f216125d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}突尼斯之役的完胜，不仅为你赢得了全欧洲“基督信仰守护者”的美名，也为你树立了真正贵人的名声——对敌人毫不留情，对降者却宽厚以待。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13768
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13774
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_66beb8ab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你回答他说，败者没有资格提条件，唯有俯首认命。随后，你把突尼斯交给手下洗劫。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13776
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_91d6bb5f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}到夜幕降临之时，城中的街巷已流淌着血河，许多街区陷入了火海。{vspace=5}{w}真可谓，败者之苦。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13778
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_3e5de167:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在城中缴获的丰盛战利品中，有一颗硕大的未切割钻石——它是苏丹宝库中的至宝之一，名为“沙漠之泪”。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13781
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_8125b785:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你留下一位总督治理新占的土地，随即扬帆返航。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13783
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_cd54a11e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}突尼斯之役的完胜为你赢得了全欧洲“基督信仰守护者”的美名，但也让你成了嗜血残暴的典范——即便是已经俯首投降、本可指望得到善待的人，也难逃你的毒手。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13785
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:13796
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_4_africa_end_c2c2d9fc:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}权威增加[player_kingdom_authority_change]。{vspace=5}人气（贵族）增加[player_kingdom_rep_nobles_change]。{vspace=5}人气（平民）增加[player_kingdom_rep_commoners_change]。{vspace=5}人气（教会）增加[player_kingdom_rep_church_change]。"

