# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14763
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_44c5aa1c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，夺取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的奇彭纳姆……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14773
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_1c826e2c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，夺取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的布里斯托尔……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14784
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_4c48d4e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，夺取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的格林威治……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14794
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_dffbbcee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，夺取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的达特福德……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14804
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_92d94a01:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，攻取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的英格兰南部……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14814
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_91ea3b32:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，攻取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的英格兰西南部……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14824
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_3b48b920:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意出兵，夺取由北安普顿率领的保王派军队据守的梅德斯通……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14835
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_fe9bd524:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意挥师英格兰中部，那片土地正由剑桥公爵牢牢掌控……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14845
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_00232aa4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意对剑桥公爵的要塞发起进攻……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14856
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_faf7ce34:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意向苏格兰人占据的土地发起进攻……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14866
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_faf7ce34_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意向苏格兰人占据的土地发起进攻……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14902
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_d102d9e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}金钱不足！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14904
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_menu_campaigns_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14944
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14950
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14953
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_aa4d9ca7:

    "{cps=50}苏格兰人攻占温莎，得以兵临首都城下，伦敦面临被合围的威胁。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14955
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_18450359:

    "{cps=50}苏格兰人攻占温莎，詹姆斯国王与剑桥公爵的联军得以兵临首都城下，伦敦面临被合围的威胁。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14958
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_4c1d42d1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明白，若将主动权尽数拱手相让，拥兵数万的敌军足以切断通往首都的一切补给线，把全城活活饿死。你决定冒险一搏，{w}{vspace=5}在野战中与敌一决胜负。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14960
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_b1909aeb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}狡黠的政治手腕与精密的权谋已施展殆尽，接下来，轮到刀剑说话了。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14962
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_e93d857c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伦敦王国与整个英格兰的命运，即将在伦敦城外的原野上揭晓。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14964
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14979
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_10209657:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你集结了麾下所有可用之兵，在首都城下与敌军决战，然而命运却背弃了伦敦王国。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14981
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_e20b14e7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在敌军的冲击之下，你的人伤亡惨重，开始溃逃。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14983
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_25d1645d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为扭转败局，你率护卫亲兵孤注一掷，冲向敌军阵中，企图斩杀一名将领，扰乱其指挥。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14985
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_ffd4f0e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你未能如愿。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14987
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_97768935:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你陷身于敌军层层阵列，四面受敌，被拽落马下，殒命于乱刃之下。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14989
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_80ee9fc1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与你一同赴死的还有艾丽莎。她自卧室窗前目睹了整场战事，在胜负已成定局的那一刻，服毒自尽。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14991
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_ae970494:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}新生的伦敦王国就此从地图上消失，永远成为一场短暂的误会，连编年史与典籍中都不会留下只言片语的记载。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:14993
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15005
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_2c038543:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伦敦城下这场辉煌的胜利，为[storyroll!ti]詹姆斯国王剿灭伦敦王国的一切图谋画上了句号。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15007
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_2d488fad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}溃败的敌军残部四散奔逃，消失在英格兰南部无垠的田野与密林之中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15009
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_85d0c8e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}苏格兰人要再组建一支这样的军队[storyroll2!ti]，显然力不从心。北境再次入侵之忧，你可以高枕无忧许久了。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15011
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15024
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_9292e268:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你坚决击退了詹姆斯国王的军队，[storyroll!ti]苏格兰人征服伦敦王国的图谋就此彻底破灭。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15026
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_f2527587:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}时间站在你这一边。战事毫无进展，损兵折将，再加上粮饷与补给难以为继，詹姆斯国王很快便不得不把军队撤回北方——在那里，供养、补充与补给都要容易得多。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15028
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15030
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_b8be3a84:

    "{cps=50}至于剑桥公爵，他也在伦敦一战中折损了大量可战之兵，如今只愿退守不出，不得不接受现实——由你统御的伦敦王国已成定局，无可更改。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15036
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_33bf04fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}南方的局势也随之安定下来。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15038
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_80ca6ead:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尚未从你的背叛中缓过劲来的保王派依旧兵力有限；而在你大胜苏格兰人之后，北安普顿终于彻底放弃了夺回伦敦的企图。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15040
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_abfe21e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他转而全力经营南方，巩固自己的权势。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15043
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_ccbf54e4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伦敦的对手们在你的防线前撞得头破血流，彻底丧失了战争的主动权。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15045
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_fa7be88e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，不容回避的现实是，你自己的资源也已消耗殆尽。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15047
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_fca89ad8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场血腥而漫长的内战，又因北方邻居的屡次介入而雪上加霜，英格兰的土地被榨干鲜血、洗劫一空——你的领地受损尤为惨重。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15049
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_d668c889:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}正因如此，即便敌人已然衰弱，反戈一击也只能是奢望。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15051
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_dec563d0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一如常理，双方并非立刻认清僵局。自苏格兰军在伦敦城下覆灭后的大约一年半里，英格兰各地仍有小规模冲突与战斗不断发生。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15053
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15068
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_f6afe479:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}[storyroll!ti][storyroll2!ti][storyroll3!ti]此后你们依旧明争暗斗，相互袭扰边境的城堡与要塞，组建新大军的企图也始终未断。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15070
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_d711df60:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而每一次交锋的规模都比上一次更小，每一场军事冒险的军费也比上一场更为拮据。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15072
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_382d7fa4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}战果亦复如是。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15074
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_b06a731c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终，眼看继续冲突毫无前景，加之贵族、教会与商贾的施压日益沉重，双方终于坐到了谈判桌前。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15076
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_a92046f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}经过数月的唇枪舌剑与被迫的相互让步，英格兰——如今正式地——分裂为若干互不统属的领地。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15078
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15081
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_5b521737:

    "{cps=50}詹姆斯国王吞并了英格兰北部的旧地，约克城亦在其中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15082
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15085
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_f4d795c9:

    "{cps=50}剑桥公爵大肆扩张公国疆域，将英格兰中部的大部分土地收入囊中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15086
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15089
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_e6e91f81:

    "{cps=50}北安普顿据有整个南方，在那里宣告成立一个新的英格兰王国。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15090
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15092
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_eb34c685:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而你分得伦敦及其周边、首都以西的土地，以及原坎特伯雷伯爵领地的一部分。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15094
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_finale_1_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15117
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_3f348a48:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}忠于伯爵的军队试图抵抗你的大军，却无济于事。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15119
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_bc332b7d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你挥师疾进，逐一夺取北安普顿盘踞的各个地区，随后在梅德斯通城下的决战中，将其残部一举击溃。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15121
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_679aafd9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}梅德斯通的陷落，标志着伦敦以南的土地尽数落入你的掌控，与你为敌的旧保王派势力就此彻底土崩瓦解。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15123
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_2a5af43e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}美中不足的是，如同在伦敦时那样，北安普顿又一次从你手中溜走，消失得无影无踪。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15125
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_4025c142:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过如今他已失去全部资源与盟友，谅也构不成什么威胁。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15127
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_earl_defeated_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15133
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_34067a36:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你挥师北上，接连重创剑桥公爵的军队，将其广袤的领地尽收囊中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15135
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_51d52398:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}公爵坚信苏格兰人定会来援，始终拒绝弃守自己的要塞，绝不肯让其落入洗劫之手。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15137
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_6c63a8e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而他打错了算盘——最先出现在他要塞城下的并非盟友，而是你的军队。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15139
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_4080d166:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}经过数小时的猛攻，公爵的要塞陷落，他本人也成了你的阶下囚。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15141
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_59778491:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你将他押回伦敦，举行了一场公开审判。法庭认定他犯有叛乱与背弃王室之罪，判处死刑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15143
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_e5272385:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}判决在首都中心广场当众执行，数以万计的民众围观欢呼。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15145
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15148
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_f429540c:

    "{cps=50}{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}权威提升 [player_kingdom_authority_change]。{vspace=5}人气（平民）提升 [player_kingdom_rep_commoners_change]。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15152
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_5_cambridge_defeated_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15180
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_038ebdad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}旧王国中唯一不服从伦敦的独立残片，只剩下剑桥公国。公爵待价而沽，总想等个更好的时机，既错过了投靠坎特伯雷的机会，也错过了投靠北安普顿的机会，最终落得只能与你单独对峙的下场。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15182
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_e8d792b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若在一两年前，你或许还愿意做出重大让步，将他拉拢到自己麾下；然而如今，为时已晚。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15184
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_4c09792b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，公爵手中还藏着一张底牌——与苏格兰人的盟约。趁你解决梅德斯通之战的工夫，这支盟军已然完全到位。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15186
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_4951f5f6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}苏格兰军队越过早已无人设防的北方边境，长驱南下。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15188
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_55878342:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明知他们的目的是与剑桥公爵会师，却依然决定不急于求成、不去各个击破，而是反其道而行之，把时间全部用在集结军队、动员一切可用资源之上。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15190
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_e0aa8be0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}远征法国的失败与随之而来的旷日持久的内战，使王国的许多土地化为焦土、国库空虚；但另一方面，也留下了一支庞大的老兵队伍——他们身经百战、意志如铁，积累了无比宝贵的经验。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15192
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_ff09e280:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}反观剑桥与苏格兰的军队，虽然兵员更新、锐气正盛，但其中大多数人连类似经验的四分之一都及不上。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15194
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_f7b1409d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你身经百战、亲历过无数战事，深知一名由良将统领的老兵，抵得上五个乃至十个新兵。因此，当你以久经沙场的老兵组建起一支满编大军时，便有十足把握在野战中击败剑桥与苏格兰的联军。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15196
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_69daebd3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}验证这一信念的战场，便是剑桥与伦敦之间的平原——两军在此集结，准备决战。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15198
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_11f9b5e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你按事先精心筹划的部署列阵完毕，亲率士卒当先而出。一位苏格兰贵族骑士在战场上发现了你，立刻率队直扑而来……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15200
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_6_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15496
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_1_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15554
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_1_postfight_8a1438c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}战胜敌骑令全军士气大振，也成了你麾下大军全线进攻的信号。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15556
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_1_postfight_e80dbb3a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你打算撕开苏格兰阵线的中央，将敌军一分为二，于是向构成敌军阵列中段的三队枪兵发起冲击。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15558
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_1_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:15952
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_2_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:16024
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_final_showdown_2_postfight_819d8e7a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见你的进攻将他的军队劈成两半，苏格兰国王孤注一掷，将自己麾下最精锐的重甲骑士亲卫队投入战场。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:16026
