# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17299
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_9591b4ca:

    "{cps=50}你投入战斗，却深陷于敌军的防御阵型之中，无力左右战局。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17301
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_e3b72e4b:

    "{cps=50}你投入战斗，却深陷于敌军的防御阵型之中，眼看唾手可得的决定性胜利悄然溜走。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17303
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_e6e66c62:

    "{cps=50}你投入战斗，却终究无力回天，忠于你的军队惨遭溃败。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17308
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_bfa8cf27:

    "{cps=50}你以雷霆一击冲垮敌军阵型，助己方将士赢得了这场战斗。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17310
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_e0efb17f:

    "{cps=50}你以雷霆一击冲垮敌军阵型，将敌人大军尽数驱散。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:17312
translate chinese kingdom_of_london_universal_postfight_b12a6a60:

    "{cps=50}你以果断的反击暂时遏制住敌军的攻势，让己方将士得以撤退，免于一场灭顶之灾。"

