    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19615
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_1c46ebcc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}胜利令部分盟友士气大振，他们已开始追击败退的法国人。嗅到贵重战利品与可赎俘虏的气息，你也不禁盘算着加入这场追逐。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19617
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19621
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_cad4c59e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你加入追击，很快便在败退的人群中发现一名身披华美甲胄的骑士。看他的动作，他伤势沉重，只能倚靠身边侍从的肩膀艰难前行。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19623
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_7ec65d40:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你追了上去，从背后一击将骑士打倒，盘算着先迅速解决掉侍从，再宣布骑士成为你的俘虏。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19628
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_3b997152:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而谨慎占了上风，你决定今天的冒险到此为止。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19915
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_35b1aaee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}又挨了一击，骑士重重瘫倒在地，举手示意求饶……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19917
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_finish_him_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19921
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_2fec7e20:

    "{cps=50}你决意饶骑士一命，正要开口宣布他已成为你的俘虏。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 +10！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19923
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_9bbaf88a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，那名你一时疏忽忘在脑后的侍从抓住你的破绽，重重一击砸在你头上，眼前顿时一黑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19925
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_61b952c5:

    nvl clear
    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19931
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_b725e632:

    "{cps=50}你决意饶骑士一命，向他宣布他已成为你的俘虏。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 +10！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19933
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_8e5eff19:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，这位骑士非但不为保全性命而道谢、不承认自己被俘，反而掀起盔面，朝你脸上啐了一口，破口大骂起来。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19935
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19940
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_9286e6b0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若是涵养稍差的人，早已一剑结果了这个无礼之徒，可你终究更为仁慈……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19942
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_300b67ab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}只是朝他一处正在流血的伤口补了一脚，聊作惩戒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19944
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_3312f344:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑士痛得龇牙咧嘴，连骂人的话都噎了回去，你则满意地咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19946
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_d8f606ee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，这份得意来得未免太早。你只顾着跟骑士你来我往地“斗嘴”，忘了留意周围的动静。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19948
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_a782fc95:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你丝毫没有察觉，几名法国战士正悄悄逼近——他们赶来搭救自己的同伴。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19950
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_54fe125d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其中一人趁你疏忽，悄然摸到近前，狠狠一击砸在你头上，你眼前顿时一黑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19952
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19957
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_finish_him_53cb1402:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你理智地想到，俘虏远比尸体麻烦，于是抡起一击，结果了这位骑士。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 -20！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:19959
translate chinese tod_dlc_intro_finish_him_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

