# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:22243
translate chinese road_to_rouen_postfight_fd75758f:

    "{cps=50}解决了强盗之后，你们继续向鲁昂进发，一个时辰后便闯入了公爵的府邸。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:22246
translate chinese road_to_rouen_postfight_aee89356:

    "{cps=50}击败那股匪徒后，你返回了瓦泽勒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:22248
translate chinese road_to_rouen_postfight_ab055d64:

    "{cps=50}眼见战局不利，你宁可一无所获也要保住性命，选择了撤退。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德 -5！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）-5！"

