    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23782
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_ba593684:

    "{cps=50}你的努力毫无收获……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气、队中的强盗、在鲁昂及周边的人脉——失败！{vspace=5}时间 -1。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23807
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_4e7ac9eb:

    "{cps=50}你的努力没有白费，靠着一点一滴的拼凑，你逐渐摸清了那伙强盗的情况以及他们可能的藏身之处。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23808
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_1f270994:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把情报交给卫队长，他当即命令手下缉拿那伙恶徒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23810
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23814
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_03e77779:

    "{cps=50}你决定亲自参与缉捕强盗。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 +10！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23816
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23821
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_20c681c9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}城防卫队成功擒获了匪徒，粮草安然无恙。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 +15！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23826
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23834
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_44298906:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}身为一个不止一次站在律法对立面的人，你毫不费力便与当地黑道的头面人物搭上了线，并约见了匪帮的首领。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚低下——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23836
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_13298e84:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}匪首与你在一处僻静之地私下会面，亲口承认确有洗劫某个粮仓的计划，打算囤积居奇、倒卖粮食，狠狠敲上一笔富裕市民的竹杠。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23838
translate chinese rouen_city_of_thieves_city_menu_info_buy_roll_fail_749e1372:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他还承诺：只要你帮他引开城防卫队的视线，他不仅愿意分你一大笔赃款，还会在叛军得势时助你逃出城去。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:23840
