# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26661
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_warning_94206b1e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}拉格兰派来的使者带来警告：他的眼线截获了消息，有人正在密谋行刺德·罗什。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26663
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_warning_b91b7792:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管他的手下暂时还没查到更确切的情报，拉格兰仍建议你多加提防。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26665
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_warning_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26675
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_bab3c349:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}拉格兰的顾虑果然应验。示警不出数日，德·罗什的巴黎府邸便遭了一伙无名刺客的突袭。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26677
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_5796c798:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此时你恰好前来向长官请示后续任务，正身在其府邸——你从书房的窗口，目睹了楼下展开的激战。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26679
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_f10e935d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你劝长官趁为时未晚，尽快离开府邸避入安全之处，却被他断然拒绝。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26681
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_676333f7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗什表示，自拉格兰警告之后，府邸的护卫已大大加强——其中不乏国王的人手——因而并无多少忧虑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26683
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_64b0a7ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他既不肯躲进密室，更不愿出逃——只让你安心等候，看他的护卫如何收拾那些刺客。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26685
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26688
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_a20b6d49:

    "{cps=50}你拒绝袖手旁观，抓起武器便赶去助护卫一臂之力。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26689
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26693
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_d925e461:

    "{cps=50}你命令自己的人留在原地，守护德·罗什的书房。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 +5！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26700
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_4e61be00:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你驰援府邸护卫来得正是时候——刺客们正用精准的弩箭，将德·罗什的人一个个放倒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26702
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_d7aec44a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拔出武器，加入了战斗。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26706
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26710
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_7bc42290:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你认同他的道理，没必要拿性命去冒险，便留在长官身边。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26713
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_c786859d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗什的判断没错。苦战约一刻钟后，刺客们被层层护卫缠住，眼见无法得手，只得撤退。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26715
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_b94a8f07:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗什本想组织追击，可幸存的部下非伤即疲，派他们去追显然毫无胜算。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26717
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26720
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_367bf389:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见无人可托，你决定亲自追击。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26722
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_928031df:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你合理推断，刺客唯一的退路便是府邸旁的树林，于是纵马急追……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26724
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26735
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_359d1a74:

    "{cps=50}幸运站在你这一边。全力追赶之下，你终于在一段时间后追上了刺客。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力、协调、运气——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26739
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26743
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_7025841e:

    "{cps=50}然而，你没能追上刺客。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力、协调、运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26744
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26747
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_55dd815d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你本想亲自追击，但理智的声音止住了你的脚步。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26749
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_intro_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26754
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_outro_bad_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26767
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_outro_good_2c4d0080:

    "{cps=50}仗着你的雷霆手段，两名刺客皆已伏诛。然而[storyroll!ti]要想从死人嘴里撬出半句真言，却是难如登天。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26768
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_outro_good_8566b650:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}拉格兰的人收走了尸体，承诺会查明这两人的身份与幕后主使，可直觉告诉你，你恐怕听不到什么有价值的结果。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:26770
translate chinese paris_second_assassination_outro_good_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

