    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}王太子被关押在康西尔热里城堡的地牢中，戒备森严。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28861
translate chinese paris_prison_aa4199fc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明白潜入其中绝非易事，于是盘算起可行的办法……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28863
translate chinese paris_prison_99bd6835:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}队伍中某些职业、且等级足够的成员，或许能为你提供各种帮助。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28865
translate chinese paris_prison_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28953
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28957
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_26fb5ad7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你需要潜入康西尔热里，[ally1_advice_name!ti]表示他能帮上忙。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}队中有骑士——成功！{vspace=5}盟友等级——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28959
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_aa3420e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他说，他认识一位守备队长——人倒是不坏，却深陷债务，急需用钱。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28961
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_fc384191:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}[ally1_advice_name!ti]确信，只要出得起价，那位守备队长就能放你进去。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28963
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

