    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}损失 [ally1_bribe_sum] 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28971
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_8516ff40:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}由[ally1_advice_name!ti]出面牵线，你与守备队长搭上了关系。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28973
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_8c146a34:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他同意收你 800 弗罗林，放你潜入其中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28975
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28978
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_94547691:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}金钱不足！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28979
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28984
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_e730abde:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你需要潜入康西尔热里，[ally2_advice_name!ti]表示他能帮上忙。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}队中有强盗——成功！{vspace=5}盟友等级——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28986
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_fc48ca41:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他说，几年前他曾参与过一次越狱大行动，从康西尔热里逃出不少囚犯。此后守卫自然加强了，但关键的漏洞至今仍在，潜进去再溜出来并非难事。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28988
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_7a14ce6f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你仔细听完[ally2_advice_name!ti]的指点与叮嘱，决定按他的法子试试潜入康西尔热里……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28990
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28995
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_7a8150f4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}趁着夜色掩护，你尝试潜入监狱。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:28997
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29002
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_1b002986:

    "{cps=50}你成功了。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29003
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29006
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_bd290cd6:

    "{cps=50}然而你的身手并不给力。你很快便被守卫发现，只得仓皇逃命。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29007
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29009
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_2f3a096f:

    "{cps=50}撤退时你反应慢了半拍，被追兵砍伤了几处。{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳——失败！{vspace=5}生命力 -2！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29012
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_b8bbc94f:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳上升！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29014
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29019
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_06e9e601:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你需要潜入康西尔热里，[ally3_advice_name!ti]表示他能帮上忙。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}队中有农民——成功！{vspace=5}盟友等级——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29021
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_540a61af:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他说，从军之前他干过营建行当，还参与修筑过康西尔热里的一座新塔——那座塔可以直通关押囚犯的地牢。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29023
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_8e820985:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他说，那座塔有一条藏在塞纳河水下的密道。只要你水性好、憋得住气，大可从那里潜入。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29025
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29028
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29030
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_8f50f67f:

    "{cps=50}你依照指示，尝试经由水下的密道潜入康西尔热里的一座塔楼。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29031
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29037
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_a2f43e9c:

    "{cps=50}在水下摸索入口绝非易事。所幸你耐力惊人，硬是憋住一口气，找到通路钻了进去。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}耐力、运气——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29038
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_13:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29041
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_251950a2:

    "{cps=50}在水下摸索入口绝非易事。你几次试着憋足长气，想找到通路钻进塔里，可耐力每次都先撑不住。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}耐力、运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29042
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_14:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29044
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_d3bc80c1:

    "{cps=50}数次尝试无果，为了不被淹死，你决定放弃这个计划。灌了一肚子水、险些沉底之后，你总算狼狈地爬回了岸上。{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳——失败！{vspace=5}生命力 -1！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29047
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_e1433968:

    "{cps=50}数次尝试无果，为了不被淹死，你决定放弃这个计划。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳上升！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29049
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_15:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29054
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_17d95965:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你需要潜入康西尔热里，[ally4_advice_name!ti]表示他能帮上忙。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}队中有吟游诗人——成功！{vspace=5}盟友等级——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29056
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_69fdb7ae:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他提出的计划听起来简直疯狂，可[ally4_advice_name!ti]那笃定的口气极具感染力。还没等他说完，你也开始觉得，这法子没准真能成。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29058
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_2ec9b68f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他的主意是：让[ally4_advice_name!ti]在康西尔热里的城墙下找个位置，然后扯开嗓门弹着鲁特琴，放声高唱强盗小调。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29060
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_466e0596:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场“演出”定能引来狱中囚犯的应和，也会招来守卫——他们十有八九会赶来制止。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29062
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_5a0f1f9c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为了把水搅得更浑，还可以备上几瓶麦酒或葡萄酒，分给那些闻声赶来的看客与闲汉。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29064
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_a4afb4a5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}趁着守卫拨开人群去捉拿乐手之际，你便能在混乱的掩护下溜进监狱。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29066
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_6b5aec63:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接下来的事，就全看你自己了。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29068
translate chinese paris_prison_menu_76b2fe88_16:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29098
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_65a03eb8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}[ally4_advice_name!ti]的判断没错，事态完全按他的剧本上演。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29100
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_7a2cb043:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}洪亮的鲁特琴声与那首关于“绿林好汉身陷囹圄”的悲歌引来了囚犯们的注意，他们齐声应和起来。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29102
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_a23a944a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}附近的闲人被歌声与免费酒水吸引，纷纷聚拢过来，围着歌手喧闹起哄。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29104
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_6fb4cdbb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}趁康西尔热里的守卫手忙脚乱地制止这场闹剧，你顺利潜入了监狱。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29106
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29109
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_343bc720:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}背包中的酒水不足！{vspace=5}需要：[prison_infiltaration_alcohol_required]"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29111
