    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29116
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_15a7c945:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你需要潜入康西尔热里，[ally5_advice_name!ti]表示他能帮上忙。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}队中有战士——成功！{vspace=5}盟友等级——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29118
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_11ca0168:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为人粗豪却颇有急智的[ally5_advice_name!ti]建议来一手简单粗暴的：披上带兜帽的斗篷，抄起棍棒，等入夜后瞅准时机，敲晕守卫，再摸进去。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29120
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29171
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_3ead37ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你和[ally1_advice_name!ti]披上斗篷，尝试潜入康西尔热里……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29173
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_94b6d1a4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你利落地敲晕了途中遇到的几名守卫，顺利摸进了监狱的地牢。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29175
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_35ae129e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}确认你已平安抵达目的地，[ally1_advice_name!ti]依照约定先行撤离，把你留给了自己。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29177
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29180
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_9aab208b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}缺少必要物品！{vspace=5}要用此法潜入监狱，你需要一件斗篷/兜帽和一根棍棒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29182
