# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29207
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_730f9aff:

    "{cps=50}借着夜色，加上那双无声的软鞋，你安然穿过了守卫的视线。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29209
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_5dad4ec9:

    "{cps=50}趁着夜色，你尝试潜入监狱，却弄出了太多动静，被守卫发现了。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29210
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_97e6f7e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你只得落荒而逃。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29212
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29214
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_2f3a096f:

    "{cps=50}撤退时你反应慢了半拍，被追兵砍伤了几处。{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳——失败！{vspace=5}生命力 -2！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29217
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_b8bbc94f:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳上升！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29219
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29222
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_b5bc60c6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}穿过外围岗哨，你来到一扇紧锁的大门前——门后正是通往康西尔热里地牢的通道。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29224
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_868ef642:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你取出开锁工具，试着撬开锁……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29226
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29232
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_e41d2c3d:

    "{cps=50}你成功了！{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}手艺、运气——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29233
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_5b1b7256:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你回身掩上门，已身处监狱的地牢之中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29235
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29238
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_0dc63797:

    "{cps=50}然而，任你如何摆弄，这把锁就是不买账。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}手艺、运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29239
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_fb43a372:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终你还是被一名看守撞见，他立刻发出警报，你只得仓皇逃命。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29241
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_13:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29243
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_2f3a096f_1:

    "{cps=50}撤退时你反应慢了半拍，被追兵砍伤了几处。{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳——失败！{vspace=5}生命力 -2！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29246
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_b8bbc94f_1:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳上升！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:29248
translate chinese prison_give_alcohol_76b2fe88_14:

    nvl clear
    ""

