# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33009
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_0262565f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}穿行城中时，你路过巴黎的一座教堂。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33011
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_f6d44063:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}满城店铺宅邸或遭洗劫、或被焚毁，唯独这座教堂完好无损，仿佛一片安宁的净土。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33013
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_ad5cef62:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你走近，一位教堂执事冲你招手，示意可以进来避一避。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33015
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33018
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_542e94ef:

    "{cps=50}你在教堂里稍作歇息……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耗费时间：1！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33020
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_2a9142e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳下降！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33022
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33028
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_d74aa230:

    "{cps=50}修士们还为你做了急救。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}伤势已治愈：失血。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33031
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_0e19bc9c:

    "{cps=50}修士们还为你做了急救。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}伤势已治愈：中毒。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33033
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_church_1ef4c5e7:

    "{cps=50}你决定不耽误工夫，继续赶路。"

