    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33039
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_401ccb8a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}穿行街巷间，你撞见一名身受重伤的人——看模样是城市卫队的士兵，大概是在与叛军或盗匪的冲突中遭了殃。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33041
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_61774792:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他浑身是血，向你求救……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33043
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33055
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_6ec33feb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}失去物品——[bandage.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33064
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_8c376d98:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}失去物品——[tourniquet.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33073
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_c3bcd70c:

    nvl clear
