# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33078
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_7e3d4d6a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你帮他包扎伤口、止住血。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耗费时间：1。{vspace=5}虔诚 +15！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33082
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_ed6b71b2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他谢过你的援手，说自己简直是从被叛军占领的卫队营房里死里逃生的。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33085
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_77baf4ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}叛军如今得了兵器，而那些本该在巴黎维持秩序的士兵，倒有相当一部分成了阶下囚。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33087
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33092
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_54ef0c9b:

    "{cps=50}你表示愿意帮他，条件是让他把兵器交给你。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33093
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_cccda777:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那士兵显然信不过你，不肯交出兵器。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33095
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

