# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33101
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_f185dda3:

    "{cps=50}你一把夺过他的兵器，顺势将他推开。重伤的士兵失去平衡，仰面摔在石板路上，脑袋重重磕了一下。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33102
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_6b1abba3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}随即，他便不再有气息。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚 -30！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33106
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33110
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_c8ab8127:

    "{cps=50}你试图硬夺他的兵器，可即便身负重伤，他仍比你力气更大。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33111
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_faa6e3e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵将你一把推开，挥剑便砍，逼得你仓皇而逃。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值 -20！{vspace=5}流血！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33117
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:33121
translate chinese paris_city_navigation_wounded_menu_f75985f6:

    "{cps=50}你决定不为他耽搁工夫，绕路而行。"

