# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36497
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_16c1255a:

    "{cps=50}你拼死奋战，竭力抵抗，可双方实力终究过于悬殊。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36498
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_5e9d0b64:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗什的人马一个接一个被斩杀殆尽，他本人也身负重伤，被缴械捆绑。你独自一人又抵抗了片刻，但敌人很快将你团团围住，你落得了与长官相同的下场。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36500
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36506
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_8bd8b5ec:

    "{cps=50}你醒来时，发现自己身处一间位于地下的单人囚室。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36507
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_7eacb137:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}牢中不见天日，要数清被囚禁的日子实在困难，大约从第二周起，你便彻底乱了天数。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36509
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_9b39dde2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}匮乏的饮食与囚室的彻骨寒意不断侵蚀着你的健康。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}所有属性降低 3 点！{vspace=5}中毒值上升！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36522
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_132b4e38:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你愈发绝望，觉得自己再无活着离开此地的可能，希望与求生之志正一点点消磨殆尽。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36524
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_f1df8c7f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，你注定不会命丧纳瓦拉王卡尔的地下牢狱。过了一段时间，有人给你套上头套，将你提出囚室，押往不知何方。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36533
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_8a896f1e:

    "{cps=50}尽管卡尔一方人多势众，却依然奈何不了[storyroll!ti]与德·罗什的老兵们。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36534
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_982d674c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}城堡狭窄的楼梯与走廊使敌人无法以人数优势碾压你们，他们唯一的依仗就此化为乌有。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36536
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36538
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_dd953864:

    "{cps=50}在势均力敌的较量中，布吉尼翁与德·罗什手下老练得多的战士轻松击溃了卡尔的人马，将官邸的内室一间间收入囊中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36540
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_3827b099:

    "{cps=50}在势均力敌的较量中，德·罗什手下老练得多的战士轻松击溃了卡尔的人马，将官邸的内室一间间收入囊中。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36541
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_bfe0625f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见计划功亏一篑，自己的官邸即将落入敌手，卡尔带着亲信和一名护卫仓皇出逃。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36543
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_7fbc5e5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但你们决不会让他们逃脱。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:36546
translate chinese paris_riots_end_charles_residence_postfight_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

