# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38289
translate chinese navarre_finale_fight_2_9dc9703c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}敌军的攻势丝毫不减，你们开始且战且退，节节让出阵地……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚降低 20 点！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38358
translate chinese navaree_flee_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38362
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_bf918d64:

    "{cps=50}纵使德·罗什统兵有方，胜利的天平仍愈发向卡斯蒂利亚人及其众多盟友倾斜。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38364
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_84c253a8:

    "{cps=50}纵使你们浴血奋战，德·罗什统兵有方，胜利的天平仍愈发向卡斯蒂利亚人及其众多盟友倾斜。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38365
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_7e91b0e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}历经漫长苦战的鲁特佣兵早已疲惫不堪，兵力又逊于佩德罗一方，虽一度顽强死战，甚至在个别地段压得卡斯蒂利亚人节节后退——但他们的气力很快便告枯竭。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38367
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_db7c0633:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}德·罗什的部队被逐支击溃，相继溃逃。他精心布下的阵列土崩瓦解，化作一群乌合之众。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38369
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_42447961:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见法军败局已定，一队全副武装的卡斯蒂利亚骑士奉佩德罗之命，直冲你们阵线中央，企图生擒德·罗什。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38371
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_efae4614:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你身处另一侧翼，无法立即驰援，只能眼睁睁看着他身陷重围拼死厮杀，随即被一记横扫的斧击砸中头盔，栽倒在地，自视野中消失。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38373
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_22cb7a96:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的战场阅历足以让你明白：此战胜负已定。纵使特洛伊的赫克托尔，乃至罗兰本人亲临此地，也已无力回天。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38375
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38379
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_c5116d0f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚检定——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38381
translate chinese navarre_finale_postfight_2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38386
translate chinese navaree_flee_49c2d8cd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决意自救逃命。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38388
translate chinese navaree_flee_0cb501ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而退路已被迂回到你们身后的轻步兵队伍截断……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38391
translate chinese navaree_flee_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38395
translate chinese navaree_flee_021ea149:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定杀开一条血路，冲回德·罗什的遗体身边。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚提升 15 点！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38399
translate chinese navaree_flee_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38403
translate chinese navaree_flee_2a049819:

    "{cps=50}这场战斗持续不到两个小时，便以卡斯蒂利亚人的彻底溃败而告终。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38404
translate chinese navaree_flee_ac5a1206:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}处死被俘的国王佩德罗之后，德·罗什率军凯旋入城，不久便在布尔戈斯将恩里克·特拉斯塔马拉扶上了王座。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38406
translate chinese navaree_flee_af12ca93:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}卡斯蒂利亚战役就此落下帷幕。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38408
translate chinese navaree_flee_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38819
translate chinese navarre_finale_fight_3_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:38822
