# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47159
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_4763bfac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你来到巴利的营地，准备为他召集的兵卒授课，却发现这些学生没一个肯用心听讲。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47161
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_3932668a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这些七拼八凑来的兵卒，对若弗鲁瓦的叛乱提不起兴致，对鲁昂的存亡漠不关心，对旁的一切也无甚所谓。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47163
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_d96e22ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们满脑子想的，无非是从附近的路边酒馆弄些麦酒与葡萄酒，再想方设法躲开一切劳作，好偷偷多睡上几个时辰。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47165
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_06910834:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你既非他们的顶头上司，身份地位也无从压人，恐怕难以让他们打心底里敬服。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47167
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_6608ce42:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，若不想让操练的时光白白虚掷，你非得想些办法，赢得他们的瞩目与敬重不可。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47169
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47174
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_70c100f4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：1。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47177
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_b1bb5eff:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定把宝押在自己的口才上，在兵卒面前发表了一番激励人心的演说，条理清晰地讲明当前与叛军对峙的利害，以及操练的必要性。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47185
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_c1e354c8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你成功了！{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚、威望、运气检定——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47187
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_9e41d414:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番演说在兵卒中激起不小的反响，至少在一段时间内，让他们暂且撇下酒盏，专心投入操练。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47193
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_a32cd7d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}但你没能做到。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚、威望、运气检定——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47195
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_6478bef8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的演说在兵卒中反响平平，未能打动他们。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47197
translate chinese bailli_talk_menu_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47232
translate chinese player_treats_bailifs_soldiers_with_alcohol_f0c8ee3c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}苦无良策之下，你只好捏着鼻子走了捷径：对军汉们许下海口，只要操练卖力，定有美酒犒赏。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}失去酒水：6。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47234
translate chinese player_treats_bailifs_soldiers_with_alcohol_658d22a8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就这样，你赢得了他们的好感。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47237
translate chinese player_treats_bailifs_soldiers_with_alcohol_e558e8f4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}背包中的酒水不足！{vspace=5}需要：6"

