translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_1_6e4ec607:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你走进瓦泽勒的酒馆……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47338
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47341
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_416a619c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在瓦泽勒的酒馆中寻到那位名叫贝尔纳的骑士，提出以酬金为报，邀他加入你的队伍。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47343
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_7b1f2dc2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}贝尔纳用傲慢的眼神将你的衣着与装备打量了一番——那眼神与他自身寒酸潦倒的境况委实不衬——随即眯起了眼睛……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47345
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47348
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_21d8bf2f:

    "{cps=50}……随即轻蔑地啐了一口唾沫，声称自己不久之前还在当今国王幼弟的堂叔麾下效力，如今可不打算随随便便给什么人卖命。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望检定——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47351
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_2d9218df:

    "{cps=50}……随即赞许地点了点头，声称只要酬劳优厚，他愿意在你麾下效力。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望检定——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:47382
translate chinese oissel_tavern_talk_menu_ac07aa3d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}[squad_candidate_container_full_name!ti] 加入了你的队伍。{vspace=5}花费了 150 弗罗林！"

