# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:49270
translate chinese grace_and_glory_rouen_1_postfight_778e94dc:

    "{cps=50}贴身侍卫拼死护主，生生拖延了数息功夫。然而就是这须臾之间，德·罗什已然循着暗门逃之夭夭。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:49271
translate chinese grace_and_glory_rouen_1_postfight_3f467c2c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不愿冒险追入那未知的黑暗，决定抽身撤离。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:49275
translate chinese grace_and_glory_rouen_1_postfight_7c07eb05:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与仍在抵挡守卫的格蕾丝和格洛丽会合，一同朝出口杀去。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:49279
translate chinese grace_and_glory_rouen_1_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

