    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56316
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_fb4c33b7:

    "{cps=50}你的宫廷医师安娜请求觐见。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56317
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_2ad0cd5a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}她恳请你的准许，开设一间自己的炼金工坊，以炼制之物贩售牟利。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56319
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_23160651:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}她许诺日后从营收中定期向国库缴纳巨额税赋。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56323
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56325
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_b6564a3f:

    "{cps=50}你应允了她。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（教会）降低[player_kingdom_rep_church_change]。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56329
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_1e650918:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拒绝了，命她专心于本职。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56332
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_4_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56338
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_cee6fe2b:

    "{cps=50}王室议会议长请求觐见。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56339
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_12efe0fb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他禀报，针对你的宫廷医师安娜的告状已堆积如山。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56341
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_281d3a10:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}她被指控从事种种令人发指的试验——其中竟包括亵渎亡者遗体，她的人据说在首都某处墓园偷挖尸骸。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56343
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_6a115d3f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}安娜的行径招致越来越多不满，宫廷内外，乃至渐渐闻得风声的市井百姓，无不侧目。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56347
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56350
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_86869145:

    "{cps=50}你下令逮捕安娜，交法庭审理。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56351
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56354
translate chinese kingdom_anna_arrives_5_8da1d46a:

    "{cps=50}案情的审理快得出奇——被捕不过两周，她便被判犯有巫蛊与亵渎尸骸之罪，在满城百姓的欢呼声中，判了死刑。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（教会）提升[player_kingdom_rep_church_change]。{vspace=5}声望（平民）提升[player_kingdom_rep_commoners_change]。"

