# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56380
translate chinese kingdom_new_sources_of_income_1_d50765e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}翻阅文书后，你对国库岁入之薄深表不满，命他另辟蹊径，充实王室财源。"

