    "{cps=50}数名身兼王室议会成员之职的骑士请求觐见。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56724
translate chinese kingdom_army_training_1_b5989386:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们提醒你，你的军队如今离心离德、各行其是。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56726
translate chinese kingdom_army_training_1_1aaa0e2d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们说，伦敦王国的军队系由各色杂部拼凑而成，素无协战之默契，多数指挥官彼此素昧平生。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56728
translate chinese kingdom_army_training_1_5b9ff6ec:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一切在战场上随时可能酿成大祸。因此依他们之见，理当组织演练，磨砺各部间的协同。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56732
translate chinese kingdom_army_training_1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56736
translate chinese kingdom_army_training_1_72f48631:

    "{cps=50}你应允了，不顾若干贵族嫌“耍把戏”浪费时间而啧有烦言，坚持组织了全军合练。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耗时：2{vspace=5}军队凝聚力提升！{vspace=5}作战计划质量提升5！{vspace=5}声望（贵族）降低[player_kingdom_rep_nobles_change]。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56742
