    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他禀报：自坎特伯雷伯爵败亡、其辖地尽归你掌控之后，这些土地的归属便成了问题……"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56948
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_e682d873:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今占据这些土地的男爵与领主，大多曾追随坎特伯雷伯爵，与伦敦王国为敌。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56950
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_03b04620:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼下他们中不少人自然急于乞求宽恕，愿率残部归顺于你。只是他们的真心忠诚，尚有存疑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56952
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_494688ee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此外，你自己的盟友之中，那些男爵与领主也在指望以这些征服之地作为酬赏。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56954
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_46f16453:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}将土地分封予他们，便可向众人表明：你向来对忠仆慷慨酬功。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56958
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_9c9767ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定保留土地旧主的封地，并宣布对坎特伯雷的前支持者施以特赦。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56960
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_7d157a81:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此举可大大扩充你的封臣名册，兵力亦随之增加。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56962
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56968
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_a1eefe28:

    "{cps=50}然而你手下的人对此决议颇为不满。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}权威降低[player_kingdom_authority_change]点。{vspace=5}声望（贵族）降低[player_kingdom_rep_nobles_change]点。{vspace=5}军队增加[storyroll]人。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56975
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56979
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_fd4af1c3:

    "{cps=50}你决定将土地分封给自己人，而那些在此战中站错阵营的旧主，则处以死刑。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}权威提升[player_kingdom_authority_change]点。{vspace=5}声望（贵族）提升[player_kingdom_rep_nobles_change]点。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56982
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_4c997570:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定将这些土地收归王室所有，并判处在此战中站错阵营的旧主死刑。"

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56984
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_3.rpy:56990
translate chinese kingdom_canterbury_amnesty_44ef59a2:

    "{cps=50}此举虽可令王室国库大为充实，却严重损害你与封臣们的关系。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}权威降低[player_kingdom_authority_change]点。{vspace=5}声望（贵族）降低[player_kingdom_rep_nobles_change]点。{vspace=5}获得[player_kingdom_gold_change]弗罗林。"

